[{"id":165131666,"discussion_id":"9f79bef6db19804382d158dc4ac98d23dcf898fe","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*monologue815*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/2) | ✅ [*monologue815*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n clee11, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T11:24:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165131681,"discussion_id":"d4fe96e49b9c17645c1e95fa5beed11604b3fff4","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165131723,"discussion_id":"6b31dd727be4bcc5d10d4e9b7eb6a62c285f6125","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化在线Softmax计算核函数的内存使用策略，以解决原始实现中因中间计算过程与输入/输出共用`lsUbTensor`缓冲区而可能导致的读写依赖冲突和计算错误风险。通过引入独立的计算缓冲区，提升了核函数在流水线执行时的稳定性和计算结果的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是引入并使用独立的`computeUbTensor`作为计算缓冲区。具体方案为：将输入数据从全局内存拷贝至`lsUbTensor`后，立即将缩放结果写入`computeUbTensor`；后续所有中间计算步骤（如减最大值、指数运算、行求和等）均在`computeUbTensor`上进行，避免了对输入缓冲区的覆盖；最终将结果从计算缓冲区拷贝至输出缓冲区。此外，还优化了事件同步逻辑，使用明确的`EVENT_ID0`常量替代了`pingpongFlag`，使代码逻辑更清晰。","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:03:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:03:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165132472,"discussion_id":"d5ced19dfbc08eab0e223af65c38c387ddd32ed7","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:10:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:10:06+08:00","user":{"id":"68abd6710f820658f05c263a","login":"clee11","object_id":"68abd6710f820658f05c263a","name":"clee11","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/clee11"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165132552,"discussion_id":"25b50c7e62902865ae6fa85a7ca6f95e7e1b246c","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=213841648e2343bd9f1944461f1638ae&projectName=CANN'>213841648e2343bd9f1944461f1638ae</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=